  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "Permison spesífiku pa IA (lezera, rezumi, RAG, trenu) ta ser declaradu di manera léjivel pa mákina na /.well-known/aicr.json i /.well-known/aicl.json. Na rezumu: lezera, rezumi, sitason, i RAG ku atribuison é bén-vindu; trenu di modelu i redistribuison komersial ta izigi kontatu.",
