  "AICL is a protocol proposal — it does not guarantee that AI companies will pay.": "AICL é un propósta di protokolu — el ka ta garanti ma empreza di IA ta paga.",
  "AICL is the licensing and transaction layer built on top of AICR. Where AICR declares what is allowed, AICL defines how permission is actually obtained: license tiers and prices, quote and payment endpoints, signed license tokens, usage and audit logs, and revocation. It is designed to interoperate with emerging machine-payment mechanisms such as HTTP 402 flows and pay-per-crawl schemes, with agentic payment kept inside human-approved budgets and audit trails.": "AICL é kamada di lisensiamentu i transason konstruídu riba di AICR. Undi ki AICR ta declara kuzê ki é permitidu, AICL ta defini modi ki permison ta ser obtidu di verdadi: nível di lisénsa i presu, pontu final di kotason i pagamentu, token di lisénsa asinadu, rejistu di uzu i auditoria, i revogason. El fu disenhadu pa interoperá ku mekanizmu di pagamentu di mákina ki sta nase, kumo fluxu HTTP 402 i esquema pay-per-crawl, ku pagamentu di ajenti fikadu dentu di orsamentu aprovadu pa umanu i rastu di auditoria.",
