  "AICL — AI Content Licensing Layer": "AICL — Kamada di Lisensiamentu di Konteúdu di IA",
  "AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer": "AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer",
  "AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer (Chinese original)": "AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer (orijinal xinês)",
