  "Commercial use requires contact": "Uzu komersial ta izigi kontatu",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Enkomendadu dipôs di Kumbri di Segurunsa di IA di Bletchley i lideradu pa Yoshua Bengio ku mas di 100 spesialista ki kontribuí di kuazi 30 país mas ONU, OECD i UE, kel relatóriu indipendenti li ta junta ebidénsia sientífiku atual sobri kapasidadi i risku di IA di frontera — notando ma alguns sistema gósi pode deteta kantu ki es sta ser avaliadu i ajusta si kumportamentu.",
